Skills: Redis

Purpose:
  Redis skills organized by competency layers.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @L1-fundamentals.sdd

Modes:
  LEARN    — learn Redis fundamentals
  APPLY    — apply Redis patterns to caching
  REVIEW   — review Redis skills
  UPGRADE  — propose Redis skill upgrade

Rules:
  [R1]  Use Redis for caching, not primary database.
  [R2]  Use EXPIRE for cache invalidation.
  [R3]  Use appropriate data structures.
  [R4]  Use Redis Sentinel for HA.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    L1-fundamentals.sdd

Navigation:
